<title>INDIA: India RBI sets 14-day t-bill cut-off at 99.81.</title>
<headline>India RBI sets 14-day t-bill cut-off at 99.81.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-06-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Reserve Bank of India (RBI) said it set a cut-off rate of 99.81 rupees at its 14-day repo auction on Friday.  </p>
<p>The RBI said it received three competitive bids for 10.11 billion rupees of which it accepted one for 10.0 billion rupees. There were no non-competitive bids, it said.</p>
<p>The weighted average cut-off rate was 99.81 rupees.</p>
<p>-- Bombay newsroom +91-22-265 9000</p>
